cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "gla-variant-pipeline: harmonisation and three-level analysis of GLA variants"
abstract: "Reproducible pipeline that harmonises ClinVar, gnomAD v4.1.1 and the Galafold amenability table against NM_000169.3 and analyses the resulting variant set on three levels: CpG context, structure on PDB 3GXT, and conservation across orthologues."
